{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Path of the Ory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Tale of Loss, Survival, and the Origins of a Legend</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the rise of the <strong>Maid of Venia</strong>, before the kingdom\u2019s last hope found her calling, there was a young survivor\u2014<strong>Kayla</strong>. As a child, she lost everything. A group of ruthless bandits descended upon her village, slaughtering her family and leaving her for dead. But fate had other plans. From the shadows, an <strong>Ory warrior</strong> emerged, cutting down the bandits and taking Kayla under their wing. Now, years later, as the world teeters on the edge of chaos, Kayla must forge her own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>32-bit, retro-inspired RPG</strong>, embark on an unforgettable adventure through <strong>dense forests, ancient ruins, and lively towns</strong>, uncovering the roots of Venia\u2019s impending war. The once-thriving kingdom has fallen into disarray after a coup led by powerful nobles dethroned the king, forcing the <strong>young prince into exile</strong>. Rumors whisper that he still lives, but his whereabouts remain unknown. Meanwhile, a <strong>dark mage has arrived in Venia</strong>, shrouded in mystery and menace. With dark forces rising, will Kayla stand as a lone warrior, or will she help shape the future of a fractured land?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Beautiful Pixel Art<strong>\u00a0&amp; Retro Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Experience a nostalgic yet rich RPG world, full of detail and charm, inspired by classic adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Skill-Based Progression</strong> \u2013 Customize Kayla\u2019s abilities. Will she become a skilled warrior, an axe thrower, a staff mage, a flute master, or a blood mage? Choose which skills to develop and create a character that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Explore Venia\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Journey through <strong>dense forests, cemeteries, and a vibrant port village</strong>, each filled with secrets, hidden treasures, and long-forgotten lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd8 <strong>Live Among the People</strong> \u2013 Visit the port town where you can <strong>shop for gear, learn new skills, or simply listen in on local gossip</strong>\u2014who knows what secrets the townsfolk might reveal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>A Story of Fate and Choice</strong> \u2013 Every step Kayla takes inches her closer to uncovering <strong>the prince\u2019s fate, the rise of the dark mage, and the destiny of the Ory</strong>. Will she walk the path of vengeance, justice, or something else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 <strong>A Prequel to <i>Maid of Venia</i></strong> \u2013 Witness the events that lead to the formation of the <strong>Belt</strong>, the warrior order that will play a crucial role in the kingdom\u2019s future. This is where the legend begins. Is this how monsters came to Venia?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you shape the destiny of Venia? The path awaits.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Elementalist ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522700/8cf609403b04c860dca5a3d747f86632ff56d13c.jpg"},{"name":"The Elementalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522700/72314443af5bb7d7915c6ae9bff99ff67b20432b.jpg"},{"name":"The Bandit Caption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522700/0da97a4a283cafb5bc7d065aa4188f0ed244efc0.jpg"},{"name":"Dock Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3522700/1cf7bb48e12f8ec45834c4fbc3a8c7e7a103caf1.jpg"},{"name":"The Dock Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/